WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.336
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Appreciate it.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:07.807
-I just -- I just went to
my first black barber shop.

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:09.408
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:11.343
It wasn't a choice.

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:14.814
I just saw the barber pole,
and I needed a haircut.

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.849
And I walked in.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.717
And I saw it was all black guys.

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:21.687
And at that point, you can't
just go, "Oh, uh, sorry."

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.823
Didn't know
it was one of these ones,"

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:28.161
and walk away.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.962
I stayed in there.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.697
Took it.

00:00:31.697 --> 00:00:33.432
I got the straight-razor shave.

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:34.701
I'm not sure if you guys know
what I'm talking about --

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:37.603
the old-timey shave
with the hot towel on your face.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.372
But I'm highly allergic,

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:42.976
so I take an allergy pill
almost every single day.

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:44.911
I have an inhaler.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.179
If anybody wants to mess
with me, no need to heckle.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.481
All you got to do is

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.483
throw one of those
fabric-softener sheets up here.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.751
Hyah!
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.321
Just break out in hives
and run away.

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.490
So I get the shave,
and then this guy takes

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:02.428
this handful of this aftershave
eucalyptus times 10 stuff

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:03.996
that only black guys know about.

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:06.432
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah!

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:07.800
-And he...

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.003
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:13.139
And he slaps it on my raw face.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.974
And I can immediately feel
my skin just go --

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.076
[ Gasp ]

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.344
"What the hell is that?!

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:20.379
That is not on the list
on acceptable products.

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:23.816
That is not on the list
of acceptable products!"

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:25.518
And you know what I said?

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.854
Nothing.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:29.254
Because like all black guys,

00:01:29.254 --> 00:01:31.524
I want these black guys
to think I was cool, right?

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.092
What am I gonna say?

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:36.129
"Excuse me,
extremely cool black guys --

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.999
trying not to pry -- what type
of aftershave do you have there?

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.401
'Cause I'm highly allergic.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:45.371
Take an allergy pill
almost every day, all right?

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.373
I use a hypoallergenic
deodorant.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.808
Pretty sure it's for women."

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:51.376
[ Laughter ]
Right? No.

00:01:51.376 --> 00:01:53.146
I didn't say anything.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:55.648
Those guys could have rubbed
a cat, some pollen,

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.783
and a handful of shrimp
on my face.

00:01:57.783 --> 00:01:59.052
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.054
I would have gone,
"The old cat and shrimp shave.

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.423
Thanks a lot, fellas,"
and just ran out of there.

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:09.028
But, also, I'm doing pretty good
on my New Year's resolution.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.396
I picked an easy one.
That's what you got to do.

00:02:11.396 --> 00:02:13.666
Mine was no Chipotle.

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.702
[ Laughter ]
Never going to Chipotle again.

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:19.305
I don't like it
'cause it's too nice.

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:20.373
It's too well-lit.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.941
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:24.444
Everybody knows,
if you want good Mexican food,

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:25.811
it's got to be a little scary.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:28.614
Right? You got to go to
a roach coach

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:31.417
parked out in front
of a mechanic's shop, midnight.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.352
That's how you get
the good stuff.

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:35.788
You got to walk up, order fast,
order scared.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.124
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.529
<i> "¿Cómo estás?</i> Uh."

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:45.365
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:47.466
"I'll have three<i> al pastor</i>
tacos, por favor."

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:50.236
[ Light laughter ]
"Get the hell away from me!"

00:02:50.236 --> 00:02:51.537
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.537 --> 00:02:53.473
I also like to check out
some of their other items.

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.941
You can't do that at a Chipotle.

00:02:55.941 --> 00:02:59.812
Excuse me,<i> cuánto cuesto</i>
this "Deadpool" DVD?

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:04.049
And how much for the socks?
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.049 --> 00:03:08.054
I also brush up on my Spanish
when I'm there, as well --

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:10.623
another thing you can't do
at Chipotle.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.124
"Excuse me.

00:03:12.124 --> 00:03:13.459
<i> ¿Cómo se dice,</i>

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.161
'Can your pit bull
please stop licking me'?"

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:16.696
[ Laughter ]
"How do you say that?"

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.498
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:22.702
That's right, guys.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:26.939
So, bad allergies, half Mexican,
horrible Spanish.

00:03:26.939 --> 00:03:28.707
This is the American dream
right here.

00:03:28.707 --> 00:03:30.342
[ Laughter ]
You're looking at him.

00:03:30.342 --> 00:03:31.544
It's true.

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:34.414
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:39.585
I like to think
it's specifically this.

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:43.289
Like, a husband and wife
in a strawberry field.

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:45.558
She's about to break down,
and he says,

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.628
"Don't worry, Maria.
Everything's gonna be okay."

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:49.829
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:51.797
Imagine this is all in Spanish.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:56.168
"Because, one day...

00:03:56.168 --> 00:03:58.671
we're gonna have a grandchild.

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:01.741
And that grandchild is gonna
be allergic to dairy."

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.109
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.109 --> 00:04:04.843
"His arms are gonna be defined

00:04:04.843 --> 00:04:07.447
not from lifting
full buckets of water,

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:08.580
but from lifting kettlebells

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.249
made to simulate
buckets of water."

00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:11.951
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:13.219
And he will work out

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:16.555
while the finest Lululemon
outfit money can buy."

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:18.691
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:21.393 --> 00:04:26.499
"And this boy will have
astigmatism so severe

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:29.067
that he will never be eligible
for LASIK surgery,

00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:32.238
no matter how affordable
it becomes

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:34.807
or how much
the technology progresses,

00:04:34.807 --> 00:04:38.010
because I will keep working
for this boy!"

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.279
And here I am.
Thank you very much, everybody.

00:04:40.279 --> 00:04:41.681
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.282
♪♪

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:45.784
-Hey, man.
Thank you so much.

00:04:45.784 --> 00:04:47.185
I appreciate that.
Thank you.

00:04:47.185 --> 00:04:50.622
Al Madrigal! Al Madrigal!

00:04:50.622 --> 00:04:53.058
His comedy special
"Shrimpin' Ain't Easy"

00:04:53.058 --> 00:04:55.595
is available now
at showtime.com.

